WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.469
[bluesy music]

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.539
NARRATOR: The Florida softshell
turtle spends most of her life

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:10.110
in water, but has
urgent business on land.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:13.346
She needs to get to a
delivery room and fast.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:19.919
She makes it across just
in time and starts to dig.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:26.726
Her eggs have to be laid on dry
land, and her time has come.

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.634
But this she doesn't need--

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:38.671
the attentions of the
worst midwife in the world.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:42.475
The crow's anxious to
speed the process along.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.111
The turtle knows what
the crow's after,

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.780
and she has a decision to make.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:55.121
She has to stop laying
her eggs to save them.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.223
[crow caws]

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.294
It's too late for the
first unfortunate egg.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:10.003
But the distraction gives her
a chance to head for shelter,

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:11.905
still carrying dozens more.

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:22.148
Sometimes the good of the many
outweighs the good of the one.

